--- !u!114 &820233336
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 820233334}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a8a6828637c11124c9c0472321e9dcb3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueScript
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1604998377}
  lines:
  - "Detective: Hello, I\u2019m detective Hughes. Do you mind if I ask you a few
    questions ma\u2019am?"
  - 'Gertrude: Oh not at all sweetheart!'
  - 'Detective: Where were you around midnight last night?'
  - 'Gertrude: In my bedroom, mostly.'
  - 'Detective: Mostly?'
  - "Gertrude: I couldn\u2019t sleep, so I wandered around a bit. Old people do that,
    you know."
  - 'Detective: Was Walter awake?'
  - 'Gertrude: Mhm. He was downstairs yelling at somebody on the phone.'
  - 'Detective: Carlo?'
  - 'Gertrude: Most likely. Have you seen a cat outside?'
  - "Detective: \u2026No."
  - "Gertrude: Her name\u2019s Coco. She slips out when doors are left open."
  - 'Detective: Mrs. Gertrude, I need you to stay focused.'
  - 'Gertrude: I am focused dear.'
  - 'Detective: Your husband was stabbed multiple times.'
  - "Gertrude: Such an ugly thing, don\u2019t remind me."
  - 'Detective: Do you know why anyone would want Walter dead?'
  - 'Gertrude: Walter was a liar.'
  - 'Detective: How so?'
  - "Gertrude: He\u2019s made Gertrude very sad. He kept his money secrets from her.
    And he cheated with that bad girl. He ruined everything. They fought about this
    yesterday."
  - 'Detective: Uhm Gertrude? Why are you speaking in third person? Did anything
    happen?'
  - "Gertrude: Hahaha, you wouldn\u2019t get it."
  - "Detective: Maybe I don\u2019t, no."
  - "Gertrude: People take things that don\u2019t belong to them. And then act surprised
    when somebody gets angry."
  - 'Detective: Were you angry?'
  - 'Gertrude: Not me.'
  - 'Detective: Who then?'
  - "Gertrude: \u2026Sorry?"
  - "Detective: You said not me. Plus, you\u2019ve been acting strange."
  - "Gertrude: Did I? My memory\u2019s been dreadful lately."
  - 'Detective: Mrs. Gertrude, I need you to focus. Do you remember what happened
    after the argument?'
  - 'Gertrude: Walter went upstairs and I went to the lounge to talk.'
  - 'Detective: To who?'
  - 'Gertrude: Lily was upset.'
  - "Detective: Who\u2019s Lily?"
  - "Gertrude: She cries easily. She\u2019s so annoying."
  - 'Detective: Mrs. Gertrude?'
  - "Gertrude: Oh dear\u2026 I\u2019m sorry, what was the question?"
  - 'Detective: Who is Lily?'
  - 'Gertrude: Nobody you need to worry about.'
  - "Detective: Ok\u2026 Did Walter know Lily?"
  - "Gertrude: Walter didn\u2019t know how to talk to sensitive people."
  - 'Detective: Did he hurt her?'
  - 'Gertrude: Walter hurt everybody eventually.'
  - 'Detective: Excuse me?'
  - 'Gertrude: You came in here wanting me to cry and confess or something.'
  - 'Detective: I just want the truth.'
  - 'Gertrude: Sorry. I get a bit confused sometimes.'
  - "Detective: It\u2019s ok ma\u2019am. I think we\u2019re done for now."
  - "*Gertrude\u2019s profile has been added to your suspect\u2019s folder*."
  textSpeed: 0.05
